[{"title":"西湖杂咏","author":"萧彦毓","text":"花心亭上坐，满眼是湖光。\n祇为便幽趣，能来倚夕阳。\n水边春寺静，柳下小舟藏。\n不待清明近，莺花已自忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70261,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 讥陈伯大御史","author":"萧某","text":"士籍令行，伯仲分明，逐一排连。\n问子孙何习，父兄何业，明经词赋，右具如前。\n最是中间，娶妻某氏，试问于妻何与焉。\n乡保举，那当著押，开口论钱。\n祖宗立法于前。\n又何必更张万万千。\n算行关改会，限田放籴，生民凋瘵，膏血既朘。\n只有士心，仅存一脉，今又艰难最可怜。\n谁作俑，陈坚伯大，附势专权。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70262,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小仰山","author":"萧炳","text":"万丈青山插碧天，真人炼药石依然。\n功成自此飞升去，屈指人间八百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70263,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"萧埙","text":"辽鹤归来世已殊，忽悲身晚及塘蒲。\n乾坤浩浩琴三尺，岁月堂堂酒一壶。\n剡曲祇今书贺监，稽山在昔庾肩吾。\n行吟便是江南史，它日真堪付董狐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70264,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还珠洞次曾宏正韵","author":"萧桂林","text":"标柱征南不记春，未应追感泪流痕。\n岩虚生白□心地，波洑澄清肃耳根。\n壮士于斯留显迹，大夫非此赋招魂。\n江山今古人何在，战马嘶风忆故园。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70265,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"癸水亭次曾宏正韵","author":"萧桂林","text":"□□□古碑，神奇永符谶。\n履岩俯冯夷，坐石存精祲。\n拂剑逼珠光，乘槎掉柯枋。\n风清明月怀，云隐高山兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70266,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亭坐","author":"萧泰来","text":"公馀终日坐閒亭，看得梅开梅叶青。\n可是近来疏酒盏，酒瓶今已作花瓶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70267,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅坛毛庆甫云悦楼二首 其二","author":"萧泰来","text":"一收二百里间云，诗几琴窗总向君。\n独乐何如同乐好，阑子欠著老夫分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70268,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题梅坛毛庆甫云悦楼二首 其一","author":"萧泰来","text":"楼立梅峰最上头，日随元气与浮游。\n道心快活云心似，飞去飞来得自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70269,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿友人","author":"萧泰来","text":"休运珍符应半千，崧高维岳再生贤。\n子孙已见钟三秀，富贵端应擅两全。\n日月休惊双转毂，甲庚从喜一周天。\n不须更把庄椿祝，镇作蓬壶不老仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70270,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和崔丞劝农","author":"萧泰来","text":"昨宵雨过水平平，自不归耕却劝耕。\n犊卧草根黄蕴藉，鹭飞山脚白分明。\n瀹茶僻寺同僧话，送酒芳园见主情。\n父老欢呼官长醉，归鞭止信马蹄行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70271,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"觅竹栽谢","author":"萧泰来","text":"一日非君不可无，当邻乞得种鱼都。\n珠连呈舍排成次，玉立云台画出图。\n淇奥每思文事业，渭川肯作富规模。\n自锄月地分行列，准拟清风十万夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70272,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"腊祭谒告","author":"萧泰来","text":"祠腊纷纷受誓忙，病夫药鼎对书床。\n官卑岂愿乘肥马，食俭惟知取瘦羊。\n贫见客来偏快活，老逢岁尽却悲伤。\n雪寒一事关心切，痴女奔波道路长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70273,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题渊明祠","author":"萧泰来","text":"地号古柴桑，荒祠驿道傍。\n松含义熙节，菊带晋时香。\n拂石看碑记，斟泉当酒觞。\n无由归未得，稽首意皇皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70274,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠星学张月台","author":"萧泰来","text":"富与贵在天，君子不谓性。\n贤不肖在人，君子不谓命。\n是以张月台，可疑亦可信。\n修身以俟之，人定天亦定。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70275,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 寿大山兄","author":"萧泰来","text":"七十人稀，尝记得、少陵旧语。\n谁知道、五园庵主，寿今如许。\n书底青瞳如月样，镜中黑鬓无双处。\n与人间、世味不相投，神仙侣。\n文汉史，诗唐句。\n字晋帖，碑周鼓。\n这千年勋业，一年一部。\n晔晔紫芝商隐皓，猗猗绿竹淇瞻武。\n问先生、何处更高歌，凭椿树。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70276,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"霜天晓角 梅","author":"萧泰来","text":"千霜万雪。\n受尽寒磨折。\n赖是生来瘦硬，浑不怕、角吹彻。\n清绝。\n影也别。\n知心惟有月。\n原没春风情性，如何共、海棠说。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70277,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉笥山","author":"萧逵","text":"涪翁笔下千钧重，赵尹胸中万里宽。\n宝墨几年藏瑞气，新亭今日敞奇观。\n翠屏远带斜阳淡，素练光涵夜月寒。\n苔碧印文公事少，谩寻诗句立栏干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70278,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙眼","author":"萧崱","text":"选荔过于选士难，味佳能有几登盘。\n林家新出金钗子，合入君谟谱后刊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70279,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"含笑花","author":"萧崱","text":"肥样凋成玉色仙，碧瑶幢里粲婵娟。\n道渠解笑何曾笑，只合更名小白莲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70280,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芦","author":"萧崱","text":"江客因贫识荻芽，一清鏖退杂鱼虾。\n烧来味挟蚝边雨，掘得身离雁外沙。\n春馔且供行釜菜，秋妆莫管钓船花。\n食根思到萧骚叶，痛感边声咽戍笳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70281,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送弟赴省","author":"萧崱","text":"河南萧氏粲文物，鹤在九皋无数鸣。\n小山羽翮日绚练，胆气也作虹霓横。\n挂冠亭后冷如水，旧毡半是蛛丝萦。\n恩袍谩官直斋老，书院误身吟院兄。\n凤楼好手乃有弟，铁声铮铮亦妙器。\n乡里浪传轻薄名，儿曹岂知渠大意。\n惠子五车稷下困，仲连一箭聊城至。\n博悬于投呼得卢，莫以蔡齐故第二。\n圣朝新数中兴年，进士蜕骨秋风蝉。\n梅花魁春导人去，竹叶鏖寒浇客眠。\n天方坐我茅三椽，留眼送尔宜鸿前。\n因行西湖叫和靖，为言诗苦剩狂颠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70282,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漆","author":"萧崱","text":"天以晶华累尔形，千夫敛锷可曾停。\n世间有器蒙鲜饰，林下无辜受割刑。\n斫坏孙枝难老大，摧残去干易凋零。\n退思禹贡周征日，未必如今税不征。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70283,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陆冰","author":"萧崱","text":"标格真清挟雪霜，每听新咏觉神伤。\n茶分鸿渐经中味，菊爱龟蒙赋里香。\n圃积玉多知学饱，囊装金少为贪忙。\n向来笑疾难医在，老笔空钞十卷方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70284,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"恋绣衾","author":"萧崱","text":"倚阑闲看燕定巢。\n旧弹筝、因病久抛。\n画不尽、残眉黛，被东风、吹在柳梢。\n晓来暗理伤春曲，把金钗、枕畔细敲。\n书寄与、天涯去，并相思、红泪一包。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70285,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"朝中措","author":"萧崱","text":"半山社雨欲黄昏。\n燕子不过门。\n杨柳染深绿意，海棠啼损红痕。\n绮寮妆束，宝钗歌舞，玉枕温存。\n一段旧情有味，十分新恨无言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70286,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 和陈漕使仙湖韵","author":"萧崱","text":"莫是西湖，分一派、残波剩碧。\n闲问著、莺仙丹事，老榕知得。\n荇水带长鸥踏损，柳风絮暖鱼吞入。\n只前山、依旧汉时青，晴还湿。\n亭疏好，何消密。\n花少好，无多植。\n听黄鹂三请，要诗翁出。\n消渴泉斟寒玉液，留题石剥苍苔色。\n叹而今、翻羡□南春，乾坤窄。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70287,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"萧崱","text":"粗花染春日晒红，细绵披夏雪辊风。\n赤皇世界岭皆热，敕旨徵绵底痴绝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70288,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"萧崱","text":"此去三千岁，应逢八字蟾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70289,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"萧崱","text":"得谤何须囊薏苡，工骚且自制芙蓉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70290,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"萧敬夫","text":"八风捲地翻雷雨，万甲从天骤雪騣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70291,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游范萝山","author":"萧照","text":"萝翠松青护宝幢，烟波万里送飞艭。\n真人旧有吹箫事，俱傍明霞照晚江。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70292,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古梅二绝 其一","author":"萧德藻","text":"湘妃危立冻蛟背，海月冷挂珊瑚枝。\n丑怪惊人能妩媚，断魂只有晓寒知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70293,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古梅二绝 其二","author":"萧德藻","text":"百千年藓著枯树，一两点春供老枝。\n绝壁笛声那得到，直愁斜日冻蜂知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70294,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"台城","author":"萧德藻","text":"六朝旧事知多少，尽在天禧塔上层。\n高处只应添泪眼，老僧语客莫来登。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70295,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立春","author":"萧德藻","text":"半夜新春入管城，平明铜雀绿苔生。\n浮澌把断东风路，诉与青州借援兵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70296,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏虞美人草","author":"萧德藻","text":"鲁公死后一抔荒，谁与竿头荐一觞。\n妾愿得生坟土上，日翻舞袖向君王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70297,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲二首 其二","author":"萧德藻","text":"相随不觉远，直到暮烟中。\n恐嗔归得晚，今日打头风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70298,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采莲曲二首 其一","author":"萧德藻","text":"清晓去采莲，莲花带露鲜。\n溪长须急桨，不是趁前船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70299,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼 其二","author":"萧德藻","text":"荒村三月不肉味，并与瓜茄倚阁休。\n造物于人相补报，问天赊得一山秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70300,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樵夫","author":"萧德藻","text":"一担乾柴古渡头，盘缠一日颇优游。\n归来涧底磨刀斧，又作全家明日谋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70301,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吕公洞","author":"萧德藻","text":"复此经过三十年，唯应岩石故依然。\n城南老树朽为土，檐外稚松青拂天。\n枕上功名祗扰扰，指端变化又玄玄。\n刀圭乞与起衰病，稽首秋空一剑仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70302,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵傅惟肖","author":"萧德藻","text":"竹根蟋蟀太多事，唤得秋来篱落间。\n又过暑天如许久，未偿诗债若为颜。\n肝肠与世苦相反，岩壑嗔人不早还。\n八月放船飞样去，芦花丛外数青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70303,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登岳阳楼 其一","author":"萧德藻","text":"不作苍茫去，真成浪荡游。\n三年夜郎客，一柁洞庭秋。\n得句鹭飞处，看山天尽头。\n犹嫌未奇绝，更上岳阳楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70304,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"萧德藻","text":"著语能奇怪，呼天与倡酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70305,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"萧德藻","text":"眼冷寒梢明数点，知他是雪是梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70306,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"萧德藻","text":"秋阳直为田家计，饶得渔村一抹红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70307,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"萧德藻","text":"秋浩荡中遥指点，一螺许是定王城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70308,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"萧德藻","text":"稚子推窗窥过雁，数峰乘隙入西轩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70309,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"萧德藻","text":"信脚到太古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"萧德藻","text":"乾坤生长我，贫病怨尤谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70311,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"萧德藻","text":"疾走建德国，乃为渊明先。\n失脚坠榛莽，刘伶扶我还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70312,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"萧德藻","text":"一筇时到崔嵬上，有底勋劳得给扶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70313,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题","author":"萧澥","text":"衣缝密密今垂老，襁褓咿咿渐趁行。\n君纵无情到闺阃，那应母子亦无情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70314,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写乐府昭君怨后","author":"萧澥","text":"古今题品几词人，莫怨边风两鬓尘。\n不是丹青曾汝误，琵琶到老一宫嫔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70315,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"写林和靖梅花诗后","author":"萧澥","text":"西湖幽处卧烟霞，湖里荷花匝四涯。\n何事先生得佳句，荷花却不似梅花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70316,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏效玉台体","author":"萧澥","text":"薄倖抛人轻似梭，忆君还似恨君多。\n此心至竟真相忆，到得恨时无奈何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70317,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江上冬日效石湖田园杂咏体","author":"萧澥","text":"溪落洲荒水半篙，枯杨两岸冷萧骚。\n田家预办来年事，加得陂头一丈高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70318,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过东平悼曾英甫","author":"萧澥","text":"前时来客此山居，同醉梅边酒几壶。\n不道后来成死别，影堂吟落一灯孤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70319,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乱定到邑","author":"萧澥","text":"蒙蒙野草自荣华，破屋夹茅人卖茶。\n满巷门基带砖石，有时认得故人家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还安舟中","author":"萧澥","text":"乱蝉鸣咽夕阳天，杨柳阴中几客船。\n岸下长江流浩浩，谁知岸上有乾田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍定庚寅纪事 其一","author":"萧澥","text":"民困饥寒为盗贼，却从乐处弄干戈。\n大都郡邑初轻视，不剪柔桑烦斧柯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍定庚寅纪事 其二","author":"萧澥","text":"稻粱平地寇难防，到处搬为塞上粮。\n路险林深多脱谷，东风绿偃满山秧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍定庚寅纪事 其五","author":"萧澥","text":"风动绿林千里乱，星垂黑气万家灾。\n可怜堕在如今劫，人祸天刑先后来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍定庚寅纪事 其四","author":"萧澥","text":"山花依旧发新丛，沟浍池塘水自通。\n前日人家无间断，颓墙破灶草莱中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客中月夜","author":"萧澥","text":"茅柴白白两三杯，客里情怀旋旋开。\n正喜江头风月好，却缘风月又愁来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70326,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"度九曲岭","author":"萧澥","text":"崎岖石径起江滨，寸步登天苦瘦身。\n行到三叉开路口，更从隔岭问樵人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70327,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昭君词","author":"萧澥","text":"琵琶马上去踌躇，不是丹青偶误渠。\n会得吴宫西子事，汉家此策未全疏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70328,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读文君白头吟","author":"萧澥","text":"不顾此身轻夜驰，晚年吟苦亦奚为。\n从来簪折瓶沈事，已在双鬟暗合时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70329,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读史 其二","author":"萧澥","text":"何事汉庭羞哙伍，竟于钟室起疑猜。\n腰间刀剑少年气，尚出淮阴跨下来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70330,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读史 其一","author":"萧澥","text":"雁门翼处不身亲，成事安知非楚人。\n何事当年良史笔，啬于一传著功臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70331,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读秦纪","author":"萧澥","text":"筑了连云万里城，春风弦管醉中听。\n凄凉六籍寒灰里，宿得咸阳火一星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70332,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寇中逃山 其一","author":"萧澥","text":"三三两两伏茅茨，有事难言只自知。\n心破胆寒无处著，风枝露叶亦惊疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70333,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"常山舟中","author":"萧澥","text":"两岸人家峙两楼，中间一水过行舟。\n倚篷碎擘桃花片，乱掷江心试急流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70334,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]